Description: Run Windows apps and games (like Pokemon fan games) with Wine
 Beer is a simple app for running Windows programs on Linux, FreeBSD and
 macOS. It manages "bottles" (separate Windows environments), installs Wine
 for you, and has a one-click setup for Pokemon Essentials / RPG Maker fan
 games.
